WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.071
Lab 2 runs one change in your own test
tenant: worldwide or G C C, never production,

2
00:00:06.071 --> 00:00:09.776
with Entra ID Governance
trial or test licenses,

3
00:00:09.776 --> 00:00:13.388
and test users whose hire
date is a few days away.

4
00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:16.313
Export the tenant's
workflows, plan one change,

5
00:00:16.313 --> 00:00:21.087
and send it with Graph PowerShell as
a Lifecycle Workflows Administrator.

6
00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:25.567
Set the execution limit in the admin
center, since it isn't in the API.

7
00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:28.337
Check that the manager receives the pass.

8
00:00:28.337 --> 00:00:30.787
And on the start date, measure readiness.

9
00:00:30.787 --> 00:00:34.988
The reader app needs a certificate
and one permission, the workflow read.

10
00:00:34.988 --> 00:00:39.293
To back it out, delete a workflow the
lab created, which can be restored

11
00:00:39.293 --> 00:00:43.524
for thirty days, or send the previous
file's body as a further version.

12
00:00:43.524 --> 00:00:47.272
Then remove the reader app,
its permission and certificate,

13
00:00:47.272 --> 00:00:49.337
and delete the export and output.

14
00:00:49.337 --> 00:00:51.550
The authors haven't run Lab 2.
